  "interpretationLimits": [
    "normal blueprint break entries override archetype component break behavior where present",
    "vent Normal blueprint authors RatioOfBehemothHealth=0.085, but ApplyPartPreset uses inherited IgnoreThePresetValuesThisPartHasCustomProperties=false, so effective ratio is preset 0.08",
    "preset PercentOfMaxHealth is recorded as authored; no runtime root-bone mapping or part-health initialization behavior is inferred here",
    "PartBreakData identifies break outcomes and loot caps but does not alone determine break montage selection",
    "shared stagger lookup table supplies montage options but not Sally effective stagger stages",
    "Inherited staggerable component defaults are resolved from the Bp_Behemoth component template and shared class CDO; runtime stage scaling and montage-selection interaction remain consumer behavior to verify"
  ],
  "sourceMappingCompleteFor": "component names, preset refs and effective values, Normal Blueprint part-break overrides, PhATBones and movement bones, sever configuration and reference socket transform, inherited staggerable class defaults, stagger montage lookup options",
  "phoenixRuntimeConsumer": "Part health and stagger tracking, break and tail-cut reactions, part-break healing, collision-bone routing, and sever actor spawning are wired. PartMaxHealthToAddOnBreak and loot drops are retained as source metadata without client reward replication.",
  "sourceMappedSemantics": [
    "Sally inherits the shared staggerable_bpc_CDO values (8 stages, 0.66666 per-player scaling, 30 s armor duration, 1.0 armor scale) through Bp_Behemoth; the SQ genus and Sally blueprints export no override.",
    "staggerable_bpc_CDO omits Debug1HitStagger (false); Sally AddStaggerArmor stores a local zero/zero GUID stack entry, and StaggerArmorStack is non-replicated.",
    "Effective part health ratios follow ApplyPartPreset: inherited IgnoreThePresetValuesThisPartHasCustomProperties=false, so preset PercentOfMaxHealth wins. Vent authored RatioOfBehemothHealth=0.085 is overridden by other_fragile preset 0.08.",
    "Part mapping artifact includes 11 components, effective preset ratios, break entries, PhATBones, montage durations, and actor-space tail sever transform.",
    "No Sally PartCollisionTable override was found; per-part PhATBones feed SetCollisionEnabledForBones, but both hind legs include spine_07_jnt and native attribution is unverified.",
    "Sally runtime export now includes inherited SQ genus PhATBones for front legs and tail, all eight inherited stagger stages, and the tail-cut montage selection.",
    "PhysicsAsset body inventory contains no spine_07_jnt body; shared PhATBones root therefore does not produce an ambiguous RPC bone hit."
  ],
  "phoenixConsumersImplemented": [
    "AddStaggerArmor zero-amount case records a GUID stack entry in a local non-replicated array; the record has no combat effect."
  ],
  "unresolvedRequirements": [],
